{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd","id":804675,"title":"Who are YOU in the CofD?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-09T13:51:22-08:00","id":804675,"title":"Who are YOU in the CofD?","content":"Im sure we've all entertained ideas of who we would be in the Chronicles of Darkness. So tell me, who are you?<br /> For example, im an Acanthus Sphinx Mystagogue with something in my soul that isnt supposed to be there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","user":"Rose Bailey","date":". 01-10-2016, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T14:30:05-08:00","id":804707,"title":"","content":"I always find it much easier to pick the X than the Y, but anyway...<br /> <br /> Mekhet, either Invictus or Ordo Dracul. Since I do not favour any particular covenant too much, I could see myself as a diplomat of sorts for the First Estate. The kind of guy who talks with members of other clans and covenants on their level to keep the peace. If I get that far, I could see myself joining the Agonistes (who I presume would have their roles as historians pronounced in 2e).<br /> <br /> I also think Mastigos fits, but it is a really close call for Order. I think it would really depend on my Awakening goes and how the local political scene plays out. For Legacy I tend towards the ones that deal with overcoming Vice/weakness or <i>possibly </i>even the Tamers of the Cave.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T14:47:05-08:00","id":804721,"title":"","content":"Changeling, definitely. In 1e, I'd be a Snowskin Elemental. In 2e, I'd still be a Snowskin, but I might be either an Elemental or, if I may self-indulge, a Fairest.<br /> <br /> I'd probably join the &quot;nicest&quot; court in the city and aim for Vizier status.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, I'd be one of the Silent, with the Cold-Wind and Grave-Dirt Keys. I'd probably be an Advocate and try and help ghosts move on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T14:49:57-08:00","id":804722,"title":"","content":"I'd think I'd probably lean towards being a Mastigos Reality Stalker of the Mysterium.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T15:08:53-08:00","id":804731,"title":"","content":"In other games I have my choices for them, but ive always liked Mage the most hence my using it. I categorize my favorites like this<br /> 1.Mage<br /> 2.Changeling<br /> 3.Beast<br /> 4.Demon<br /> 5.Vampire<br /> 6.Werewolf. <br /> I dont like Hunter, Mummy, Geist, or Promethean enough to find my reflection in them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T15:35:30-08:00","id":804759,"title":"","content":"Human. As good as it ever gets.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T16:12:32-08:00","id":804781,"title":"","content":"A Death focused Moros with the Silver Ladder, I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T16:29:32-08:00","id":804788,"title":"","content":"It's not what I would have wanted to end up as, but in all likelyhood, I'd be a Sin-Eater. Specificly a Gatekeeper who is on of the Prey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T16:53:06-08:00","id":804804,"title":"","content":"I'm just a mortal, like damn near everyone else on the planet. The only splat that I really think fits me is Wraith, and there's not a clear CofD analogue for me to cling to.<br /> <br /> Mastigos/Silver Ladder could work, I suppose; my politics put me more firmly with the Guardians of the Veil, but I couldn't really stomach that work. Being a Daeva or Galateid haunts my nightmares.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T16:59:36-08:00","id":804811,"title":"","content":"A Rahu Iron Master. Unless I went Pure for whatever reason, then Predator King. Gotta love the simplicity of a life on the hunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T17:23:27-08:00","id":804827,"title":"","content":"I'm a mortal.<br /> <br /> My life probably sucks more than it already does - I probably never got into college.<br /> <br /> I got picked on more in school, and the anger management therapy never happened (or even worse, it did.) I probably went to Juvie due to one of my outbursts.<br /> <br /> I work nights at a supermarket, stocking shelves next to a man who alternates between moaning about his life and making me worry about being shanked by the boxcutters we all carry.<br /> <br /> If I ended up becoming a Hunter, I'd be one of the ones that died messily before the Chronicle began, so you can show off how terribly dangerous the Vigil is.<br /> <hr /><br /> I mean, I would <i>love</i> to be able to say that I would be Awakened to the Mastigos (I'd gravitate to the Mysterium faster than you'd think), but the best I could <i>really</i> hope for would be a Sleepwalker. I am, after all, a realist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T17:47:13-08:00","id":804853,"title":"","content":"A surly Mastigos Free Counciler.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2997,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 01-09-2016, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T17:59:29-08:00","id":804861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804759#post804759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Human. As good as it ever gets.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the facts of growing up is the awareness that you're not going to be cool, though I like to think that in somewhere in alternate universe 1136-b there's an Unchained who acts an awful lot like me but has a more interesting life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T18:03:30-08:00","id":804865,"title":"","content":"I think we all realistically understand we'd most likely be humans, or have a minor template at best (and not even one of the cool ones, but something like Sleepwalker or Tier 1 Hunter). Perhaps a supernatural merit if we're lucky.<br /> <br /> I think the point of the thread isn't what we're statistically likely to be, but what we'd like to be if it was up to us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T18:14:49-08:00","id":804875,"title":"","content":"Ideally? An Obrimos that goes Free Council. <i>Hard</i>.<br /> <br /> Realistically? A very unlucky Sleepwalker.<br /> <br /> Really realistically? Probably un-alived for breaking some masquerade or another.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T18:28:48-08:00","id":804889,"title":"","content":"There's no way my animal empathy, anger issues, creative talent when it comes to writing and occasional prophetic dream/vibes/ramblings don't equal a Cahalith of either the Iron Masters or the Hunters in Darkness.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T18:40:23-08:00","id":804903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Agentwestmer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804861#post804861\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One of the facts of growing up is the awareness that you're not going to be cool, though I like to think that in somewhere in alternate universe 1136-b there's an Unchained who acts an awful lot like me but has a more interesting life.</div> </div> </div> </div>You bloody kidding? I'm awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T19:10:45-08:00","id":804919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804903#post804903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You bloody kidding? I'm awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's worth a like, Arc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T20:00:13-08:00","id":804945,"title":"","content":"I'd be an Unchained. My Incarnation would be Messenger and my Agenda would be Inquisitor, though I would be sympathetic towards Sabotuers. I might consider taking on multiple agendas, but in all honesty I wouldn't want the heat from directly interfering with the God-Machine's plans. More likely I would just pass information along to more radical Sabotuers and try to keep out of the conflict as much as I could.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T20:09:59-08:00","id":804951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804945#post804945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd be an Unchained. My Incarnation would be Messenger and my Agenda would be Inquisitor, though I would be sympathetic towards Sabotuers. I might consider taking on multiple agendas, but in all honesty I wouldn't want the heat from directly interfering with the God-Machine's plans. More likely I would just pass information along to more radical Sabotuers and try to keep out of the conflict as much as I could.</div> </div> </div> </div>So does this post count as a Compromise? I'd roll for Compromise here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T21:20:51-08:00","id":804995,"title":"","content":"I was expecting the My Immortal antitribu expies, but so far this has been disturbingly refreshing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T21:26:36-08:00","id":804999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804951#post804951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So does this post count as a Compromise? I'd roll for Compromise here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, undoubtedly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T21:29:06-08:00","id":805001,"title":"","content":"I can see myself a member of some sort of horrid cult with very little difficulty.<br /> <br /> I can only hope it's for a benevolent Arisen and not, y'know, serving the Exarchs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 06-02-2016, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T22:06:44-08:00","id":805014,"title":"","content":"Definitely a mortal, likely with a few supernatural merits or at the least a decent Occult score with some specialities. I'd like to be a Mage, but I don't think I'd be very good at it- likely wouldn't be very Wise at all.<br /> <br /> Personality wise, I'm probably more likely a Fae-Touched. Some of my friends have called me the most self-sacrificing and loyal person they know, and I'm stubborn enough to charge straight into Arcadia. And I'm a writer, so dealing with the Fae would be easy enough to pick up. Would probably end up as a Darkling, actually. Can't see myself fighting my way out of Arcadia- a Faustian bargin that leaves me feeling repulsive is more plausible. <br /> <br /> The most likely Major Template is probably Beast, actually. No reoccurring nightmares for me, but definitely reoccurring fears. Crushing fear of disappointment and failure, so I could see, depending on the angle, Anakim, Namtaru, or Ugallu.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-09T23:49:49-08:00","id":805057,"title":"","content":"With my RL interest in immortality I'd probably either make contact with lesser Immortals out of the Immortals book, or Vampires who hopefully embraced me (or will Embrace me someday). Probably of Clan Ventrue, Nosferatu, or Mekhet.<br /> <br /> \u200bI'd probably end up joining the Ordo Dracul.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T02:16:33-08:00","id":805089,"title":"","content":"Sin-Eater or Darkling Changeling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T02:23:11-08:00","id":805092,"title":"","content":"My soul is Acanthus of Free Council. One day I'm revolutionizing society and technology, next day I party with other monsters, remembering &quot;old times&quot; of myths and legends they come from. Beside, changelings and beasts are mine BFFs, and I really like to hang out with Ordo Dracul and Iron Masters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Beside Fate and Time Arcana, I surely would have Mind. ( Mine IT career also make me so much anger on Inferior Arcana of Path as Forces - it's just unfair that I cannot talk to Fae all the time and command electronic devices at the same time <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> - <i>&quot;I want to be a Wizard, both of real world and the Net!&quot;</i>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T02:38:05-08:00","id":805096,"title":"","content":"Out of the big 3:<br /> <br /> Mage I'd want to be a mastigos celestial master who is a member of the silver ladder or the seers of the throne (whoever approached me first). Focusing mostly in forces and space magic, mostly to teleport to places and teleport things to me.<br /> <br /> Vampire I'd probably be a Daeva in the Invictus and Ordo Dracul with a big focus on majesty and obfuscate and the coil of zirnitra or ascendant.<br /> <br /> Werewolf I'd definitely be a Blood Talon Cahalith with a bit of cunning renown. I'd probably also hit kuruth a whole lot, especially when I'm driving.<br /> <br /> I'd probably make a better werewolf, but I would prefer to be a mage.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T03:13:18-08:00","id":805111,"title":"","content":"I would be an Obrimos mage in Silver Ladder. Likely <i>very</i> high Wisdom. (&quot;For the last time, I'm not limiting myself, I am *focusing* my power! Also, stop being a lazy git and turn on the oven by pushing the goddamn button, it's two meters away from you.&quot; Also, safety first, you will live longer =&gt; become more powerful.)<br /> <br /> I would be interested in taking down the Exarchs (made it almost sound like some kind of a hobby here) and becoming <b>properly</b> immortal without any side effects by combining magic and science.<br /> <br /> I would likely work on creating my own special snowf- er... <i>custom made</i> Legacy, probably with Death primary, Prime optional effects.<br /> <br /> First I would explore my own soul, later Temenos - it's safer. After I would become sufficiently powerful (read: Batman would take tips from the contingencies), I would start to explore material world.<br /> <br /> Relations with other supernaturals would be most common with Vampires, Ordo Dracul in particular (duh). There would be a strong in-character dislike for Beasts. (&quot;They can justify it however they want, humanity should become stronger by pushing forward with will, not by being pushed forward by fear.&quot;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T03:45:47-08:00","id":805125,"title":"","content":"I'd be a mage in the Mysterium, probably an Acanthus, attempting to work on a great project to draw the definitive map of the entire Tellurian. (No I probably won't finish, but I'd pass my work onto the order for others to continue). I wouldn't have picked a legacy yet but I'd be planning to develop my own based on my exploration of the cosmology once I have enough knowledge of the mysteries to design the legacy correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T05:30:46-08:00","id":805164,"title":"","content":"Someone who was ripped apart to be turned into part of a Promethean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T07:17:29-08:00","id":805221,"title":"","content":"I would have to say that I would be a Frankenstein. So many anger issues and working on keeping them calmed down.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T07:28:19-08:00","id":805225,"title":"","content":"I think that I could work as a Mastigos of the Mysterium. I would probably concentrate on using Mind to enhance myself so I can understand the mysteries of the world. I'd probably meet a sticky end when I go and ask the wrong creature (True Fae spring to mind) how their magic works so I can fit it into my cosmology. I'd probably have maps like this: <a href=\"http://willworks.deviantart.com/art/New-World-of-Darkness-Cosmology-Map-drawing-309999687\" target=\"_blank\">http://willworks.deviantart.com/art/...wing-309999687</a>. all over the place.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't mind being a Psychopomp Inquisitor. Although I'd probably be the one in the Ring who no-one quite trusts. I'd be more than willing to sell someone out for the 'greater good' (of me).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 01-10-2016, 10:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T12:56:52-08:00","id":805416,"title":"","content":"If I were a supernatural I wanted to be, I'm pretty sure I'd want to be an Acanthus Mage with (realistically speaking) crippling overspecialization in the Fate Arcana. I'd proceed to win a big lottery jackpot (or have a few long nights at the casino) and try to live a long, comfortable life. Financial security is a comfort and if there was a way to do as little work as possible to get money (without compromising Wisdom) I'd do it. As for Y Splat, maybe Mysterium, since I'd want to learn every scrap of supernatural things I could and try to extend my life. Immortality would be good, but I'd want the kind where if I desired to die later, I could easily die. No complete immortality.<br /> <br /> Realistically speaking? If we're allowed to use fansplats, I'd imagine being a Beacon from Princess the Hopeful. If I became a Noble afterwards, I'd most likely be easily pulled into the Court of Mirrors. I know that sounds bad to say for those who know what the Brats are about, but it's honest. Calling would most likely be Troubadour or Mender.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":9750,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","user":"SaulottheGentle","date":". 01-10-2016, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9750_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"453"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-10T13:26:26-08:00","id":805439,"title":"","content":"either an Hunter (with a descent chance for Lucifuge) or a Sin Eater","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T18:56:37-08:00","id":806660,"title":"","content":"Someone who got way into magic, exorcism and all kinds of other esoteric stuff after that freaky camping trip freshman year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","user":"Daydreamer","date":". 01-11-2016, 09:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T19:21:38-08:00","id":806677,"title":"","content":"All 2e, by likelihood and personality.<br /> 1: Darkling changeling with the author kith, probably the dusk court.<br /> 2: Mekhet vampire, either cardathian movement or invictus, specialize in celerity and obfuscation<br /> 3: Cahalith werewolf of the iron masters. Not sure about anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":10751,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10751-belac93","user":"Belac93","date":". 01-11-2016, 10:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10751-belac93","name":"Belac93","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10751_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T07:27:51-08:00","id":807001,"title":"","content":"I'm a Stricken Advocate (5 years in remission). I think my geist is the Lost Hiker - I know it likes the wilderness, and would prefer I isolate people. No Krewe yet; I've been spending too much time with shifters and fae, but that's given me a Celtic mythos to draw on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":425,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","user":"Seraph Kitty","date":". 01-12-2016, 10:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T13:11:27-08:00","id":807244,"title":"","content":"If not me but poorer and with less access to university...<br /> <br /> A normal Mehket ingraining himself among the Buddhists in his town, while probably joining the Ordo Dracul or the Cartians, depending on how each promote itself to the neonates. I would specialize in Auspex and Obfuscation. No need to be quick when you can't be seen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T13:59:32-08:00","id":807277,"title":"","content":"Mekhet Ordo postmortem Hollow One who either rapidly gets tormented to death by his own reflection or drops into Draugrdom with <i>breathtaking </i>speed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions