lue":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T19:29:29-08:00","id":808386,"title":"","content":"I'm either an Unchained Psychopomp Tempter, or a Mekhet Dragon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":4046,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","user":"xenoterracide","date":". 01-13-2016, 11:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T13:15:38-08:00","id":809012,"title":"","content":"Either a plain old mortal (or Tier 1 Hunter at best), or a Mekhet in a Roman Polytheist sect of the Circle of the Crone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-14T13:47:56-08:00","id":809049,"title":"","content":"Well I know what I'd want to be, an Acanthus Mage, no doubt. Seeing the threads of destiny, playing with time, it'd be amazing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3326-an-fhuiseog","name":"An Fhuiseog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3326_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"271"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T04:26:14-08:00","id":810171,"title":"","content":"Almost certainly mortal, maybe someone's Fetch,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T11:32:48-08:00","id":810304,"title":"","content":"If we're talking &quot;what would you most likely be,&quot; then almost everyone would be a mortal or ghost.<br /> <br /> If it's &quot;what would you <i>want </i>to be that fits your personality,&quot;, then my first choice would be a Dragon, from either Embers or Inheritance. Which X and Y splats I got wouldn't honestly be a huge concern, because once you're able to tell people &quot;Fuck you, I'm a dragon!,&quot; everything else is details.<br /> <br /> If I couldn't be a Dragon due to circumstance or unavailability of fan-splats, then I'd want to go with Beast, as the next best thing. Mage, as a member of either the Order of Hermes or Sons of Ether, and Genius as a Grimm or Neid, are tied for third place. Werewolf would be alright, if not as good as Bagheera or Mokele though. I could deal with Sin-Eater (lot to be said for immortality), but if I became a Vampire or Changeling I'd honestly feel kinda cheated after learning about other types of supernaturals. Mummy and Demon don't really seem to be on the table; the former are too old, and the latter... well, yeah, I could be killed and replaced by one, but that wouldn't really be me, would it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T12:08:34-08:00","id":810318,"title":"","content":"I'm gonna have to say that, as tempting as being a Mage sounds, I can't guarantee that I would be Wise with my powers. I'd certainly try to, but knowing just how deep the rabbit hole goes and also what's below the hole would take a toll on my mind. Should I Awaken, I might be Acanthus, very likely an Apostate. I'd love to be capable of living longer and getting stuff done faster with Time so I'll have more time for myself. Using Fate to better prepare for life's less pleasant surprises would be a godsend, as it would take off a huge weight from my shoulders. I'd also invest in Life and Mind to do some moderate augmentation on myself. I would do my best to be in good standing with the Silver Ladder, but I'd probably enjoy working with the Mysterium and Free Council a lot more. I'd readily cooperate with the Adamantine Arrow, but I'd avoid actually fighting alongside them. I'd give a very, <b>very</b> wide berth to the Seers, Guardians and Scelesti.<br /> <br /> As for the other major supernatural templates, they all come with a ton of emotional baggage, and I don't need any more of that. Another thing that scares me about becoming a supernatural is the possibility of losing core aspects of my personality as the memories of acting in accordance to Integrity gradually fade away. Elder Vampires and Mummies disturb me greatly in this regard. Losing the capacity of understanding humanity and feeling compassion towards it would be a fate worse than death to me.<br /> <br /> With that in mind, chances are I'd end up as a Hunter who focuses on guiding other Hunters, probably through some kind of <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/MissionControl\" target=\"_blank\"><b>mission control</b></a>. I am unsure of what faction I'd join, that's a tough choice. I invest a lot into occult knowledge, develop a Supernatural Merit or two if I am lucky (which also comes with Sleepwalker status) and stay clear from all those powers and relics that come with curses.<br /> <br /> In any case, all Abyssals, Demons, True Fae and other shady tempters <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sDM_Sw6gPnc\" target=\"_blank\"><b>would get the same response from me.</b></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T14:35:20-08:00","id":810359,"title":"","content":"I run FEAR Corporation of course .....<br /> <br /> but really ... just little ol me not knowing that things that go bump in the night have teeth and claws... <br /> <br /> i think i need a night light...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01