rs/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T10:46:29-08:00","id":811935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=811489#post811489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Different question, because this one is old hat.<br /> <br /> Pick some people on the forums. Don't be a dick about it, but say what you think they'd be in the Chronicles of Darkness. Have fun, don't be a dick.</div> </div> </div> </div>DISCLAIMER: The following interpretations may range from totally false to completely wrong. Feel free to say how you felt when reading these.<br /> <br /> <b>ArcaneArts:</b> They get into the nitty-gritty of storytelling conventions and like to string readers along with cryptic answers. A Wizened Author + Trickster. Uses Talecrafting to its full extent, usually for jollies.<br /> <br /> <b>Satchel:</b> A Rank 5 Spirit of logic. Alternatively, an Exiled Analyst Angel.<br /> <br /> <b>Wyrdhamster:</b> Staunen Genius. Goes wide-eyed when there's new stuff and wants to see what it does when you poke it with different sticks.<br /> <br /> <b>Pendragon: </b>A Psychopomp Inquisitor. Tries to coordinate the Rings as smoothly as possible, and likes to plan for more than the obvious.<br /> <br /> I will give a virtual cookie to whoever makes the most hilarious interpretation of CoD me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 01-19-2016, 02:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T12:15:13-08:00","id":812005,"title":"","content":"I've actually specced myself up recently as a mortal Chronicles PC. I tried to be as impartial as I possibly could and I think it came out fairly accurate to be honest.<br /> <br /> In terms of attaching a supernatural templates, I considered a few (the ones I care about, essentially).<br /> <br /> <br /> Vampire: A Gangrel (or potentially Nosferatu with stronger Animalism), with a light link to Ordo Dracul, mainly looking at overcoming the Daylight as much as possible.<br /> <br /> Werewolf: Cahalith seems to fit me best. I think I'd work as an Iron Fang, using my job in Central London to help the Pack.<br /> <br /> Changeling: Probably an Ogre (maybe a Gristlegrinder). More than likely would work as a cook, and would potentially work with either the Summer or Autumn courts.<br /> <br /> Hunter: Not something I'd be too familiar with, but likely Null Mysteriis, or potentially The Movement (are they the guys that just look after their local neighbourhoods etc?)<br /> <br /> Sin Eater: Probably a Silent, with the Tear Stained Key, and - well, who knows. I don't have the source material in front of me. But Silent, and (I'd like to think) an Advocate, with occasional slips to Bonepicker...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3192-baileyborough","name":"baileyborough","ava