rum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=814516#post814516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I need to start watching this show. Just the shorts gave me about 10 new infrastructure ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div> Just some advice: don't skip episodes or watch them out of order if at all possible. If you really want to get into it, there's a cipher at the end of every episode to solve. <a href=\"http://themysteryofgravityfalls.com/\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> can help with solving them. Have fun, and remember, TRUST NO ONE!<br /> <br /> EDIT: Come to think of it, maybe try to avoid any mentions of the show online; the series is ending the 15th, and spoilers abound fir the uninitiated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T09:58:22-08:00","id":815535,"title":"","content":"A Mekhet who spent too many nights in the Shadows behind the Movement, until everyone forgot I was there in the first place. From the darkness I would witness the sins of the Revolution and switch to the First Estate. No one would even know of my apostasy...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T12:44:54-07:00","id":868678,"title":"","content":"Knowing my personality, I would likely end up as a Thyrsus living off the grid, with a good grasp of Space (aid in travelling), Forces (from living out in the raw elements, and perhaps Fate to aid with decision making. I'd sympathize with members of the Free Council and the Guardians, but ultimately side with the Mysterium. I would experiment a little too much with living beings and with spirits, and possibly keep a spirit of surveillance or information of some form on retainer. Not above using intimation or outright violence, or even creating a hybrid horror via Life magic to consume my adversaries. Eventually would learn some Death arcana to enter the underworld, and abuse ghosts in similar ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7876-aiwass","name":"Aiwass","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7876_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T15:40:36-07:00","id":868833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=812759#post812759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Satchel = Siten-Izu/Kitsune-Claimed confirmed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Needs <a href=\"http://worsethanmanyfairies.tumblr.com/post/127131905735/trappedinavelociraptor-kevin-is-an-inscrutable\" target=\"_blank\">more</a> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/855280-pangaea-unleashed?p=857671#post857671\">Red Shift</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T16:35:50-07:00","id":868882,"title":"","content":"Likely a skinthief who uses a permanent talisman, just killed one animal once for the capacity to shapeshift, vomited, and keeps it very, very safe from then on.<br /> <br /> Why?<br /> <br /> Because a mouse, sparrow, and/or fox can hide, and hide very well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":180,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","user":"Leliel","date":". 04-19-2016, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T17:25:11-07:00","id":868916,"title":"","content":"If I'm being realistic: probably a Changeling (I'll be more precise when 2E comes out)<br /> <br /> Like most people, if I got to PICK, I'd go with Mage, probably Acanthus Silver Ladder (from the Free Council friendly wing of the Order)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-20T09:11:02-07:00","id":869370,"title":"","content":"Despite my love for demon I know that I'd fit more with changeling. What type is hard for me to say. Maybe a fairest because my keeper decided to make what I hear true. The reason I would say changeling honestly is because my word is my bond. To break a promise causes near physical pain. Also though it isn't required in the books I do have the fey silver tounge. An out right lie may not pass my lips but a twisting or omition of the truth can.<br /> <br /> What would be my goal? To live. No I wouldn't try to take my old life. Hell I may even be on good terms with my fetch. I'd do my best to simply survive. Maybe ally with any other template I can find in case my keeper comes for me or their agents do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Dat