blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T14:21:55-07:00","id":873279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=804827#post804827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a mortal.<br /> <br /> My life probably sucks more than it already does - I probably never got into college.<br /> <br /> I got picked on more in school, and the anger management therapy never happened (or even worse, it did.) I probably went to Juvie due to one of my outbursts.<br /> <br /> I work nights at a supermarket, stocking shelves next to a man who alternates between moaning about his life and making me worry about being shanked by the boxcutters we all carry.<br /> <br /> If I ended up becoming a Hunter, I'd be one of the ones that died messily before the Chronicle began, so you can show off how terribly dangerous the Vigil is. <hr /><br /> I mean, I would <i>love</i> to be able to say that I would be Awakened to the Mastigos (I'd gravitate to the Mysterium faster than you'd think), but the best I could <i>really</i> hope for would be a Sleepwalker. I am, after all, a realist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, looking back at this...<br /> <br /> I'm essentially an Uratha who never hit the First Change. In that case, I'd probably end up being either a Hunter in Darkness Itheur, or a Hunter in Darkness Irraka.<br /> <hr /><br /> I am, however, morbidly curious as to what other people think I'd be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":1170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","user":"amechra","date":". 04-24-2016, 05:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T17:18:48-07:00","id":873395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=873279#post873279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am, however, morbidly curious as to what other people think I'd be.</div> </div> </div> </div>Purely out of unexplainable, intuitive reasons, I'd place you as one of those Wolfblooded that happen from a Lunacy Dramatic Failure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T17:23:04-07:00","id":873401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=873279#post873279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am, however, morbidly curious as to what other people think I'd be.</div> </div> </div> </div>I, too, am curious what I'd be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T17:44:20-07:00","id":873410,"title":"","content":"I'd be a 2e Changeling Darkling Larcenist, that's an easy one, hands down.<br /> <br /> I've done alot of things I'm not proud, sometimes with the best of intentions, and I've trusted people, and been betrayed, and I have betrayed those who trusted me in turn, staining my soul in a way that will never come clean.<br /> <br /> I've known what it is to have part of ones inner light extingished, and what it is to let the darkness in.<br /> <br /> I've person of light and righteousness once, but betrayals help put a large part of that out, but not all of it.<br /> <br /> I've lied, cheated, and stolen things. I looked at the most horrible darknesses within myself, and made some sort of peace with it.<br /> <br /> And while I find betrayal distasteful, if I had a good enough reason, I mean a really, really good reason, I'd do it again.<br /> <br /> I'm not evil, I still care about people, and my cat, I do nice things for people. <br /> <br /> And I believe in the power of stories, that stories can be living things (Memes), so I can't think of a being in CoD that resenants with my nature more then the Darkling Larcenist.<br /> <br /> When I read the 2e Darkling description, I was in tears, it spoke to me and made me realize things about myself, that I had never noticed before.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T18:21:38-07:00","id":873430,"title":"","content":"I would somehow manage to be both Beast and Hero at the same time. It goes better for me than you would expect, but only slightly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T20:39:29-07:00","id":875210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=873279#post873279\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually, looking back at this...<br /> <br /> I'm essentially an Uratha who never hit the First Change. In that case, I'd probably end up being either a Hunter in Darkness Itheur, or a Hunter in Darkness Irraka.<br /> <hr /><br /> I am, however, morbidly curious as to what other people think I'd be.</div> </div> </div> </div> For some reason, I can see you as a Grimm Genius after reading those confessions. The Peerage tends to be more down to earth than the Orders in Mage. You would struggle with anger, and look to your Wonders as both a form of expressing your turmoil and protecting yourself. Your Aesthetic could be Pod People, for both simplicity's sake in design and for not drawing too much attention (though you would experiment with more colorful styles occasionally). Once you came to terms with the Inspired condition, which I believe you could do, you would invest into Skafoi, Apokalypsi and Prostasia to satisfy your curiosity about the wider world from a position of relative safety. As for faction, I can see the anger and creativity leading you to the Artificers. <br /> <br /> How accurate was that? If I may ask, what do you think I would be? You have an amazing imagination, so I'm very curious.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T13:19:28-07:00","id":878029,"title":"","content":"Probably a mortal who ends up getting killed by sticking their nose where it shouldn't be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2152-phyi","name":"Phyi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2152_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T21:24:10-07:00","id":878434,"title":"","content":"Someone once told me that they think of me as a Acanthus because I run off of intuition, luck, and expecting the floor not to fall out from under me.<br /> <br /> I personally think that I work like more akin the Arisen. Working for uncaring masters, Called in at odd times, spend most chasing down things people misplaced, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T21:52:24-07:00","id":878450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=878434#post878434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone once told me that they think of me as a Acanthus because I run off of intuition, luck, and expecting the floor not to fall out from under me.<br /> <br /> I personally think that I work like more akin the Arisen. Working for uncaring masters, Called in at odd times, spend most chasing down things people misplaced, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you considered a life of excitement and luxury as a favored Cultist?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T08:47:49-07:00","id":878763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=878450#post878450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Have you considered a life of excitement and luxury as a favored Cultist?</div> </div> </div> </div>I prefer my managers a few degrees removed rather being micromanged.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-03T01:51:21-07:00","id":880814,"title":"","content":"I was a Human vampire hunter versed in crossbow marksmanship and trained to never look in anyone's eyes.<br /> I followed orders handed down from the group dispatcher and went to town on any vampire I could.<br /> Due to a rare supernatural ability to conjure and control flames, I found it easy to push the bloodsuckers to their limits.<br /> This earned me a nickname, Pyro, which I find very cliched.<br /> I would have preferred something like 'Flare' or 'Wildfire'.<br /> <br /> I fell into a trap in an unmarked crypt in Kentucky.<br /> Thanks in part to a battle beforehand with three kindred, I was fatigued and without the strength I needed to climb back out.<br /> My phone broke during the fall, thus I was unable to call for help.<br /> Today I haunt the hole I died in. I scream for help in hopes of someone finding me again.<br /> Noone comes to the crypt but the dead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","user":"Yelesom","date":". 05-03-2016, 04:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-09T11:20:40-07:00","id":886480,"title":"","content":"Let me make a second attempt at this...<br /> <br /> \u200bI'd be one of three things: An ordinary mortal, a Mekhet in a Roman Polytheist sect of the Circle of the Crone, or maybe a Changeling of the Spring Court (most likely Darkling or Ogre)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-12T20:14:09-07:00","id":889585,"title":"","content":"Early-starting mystery hunter, with <i>utterly </i>no success. Became a cynical and jaded materialist, got into a hole, tried to suicide. Finally saw the Truth, <i>just </i>as it was being snatched away, and Awakened Wrong. Opened my eyes in the hospital as an Obrimos Banisher with an improbable exit wound and a fury fit to murder civilizations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-17T06:20:41-07:00","id":892451,"title":"","content":"Dunno what I'd actually be in CofD, but I'd sure love to be one of the Arisen. Best job security in the universe, relatively short work hours, and the health plan is nothing to scoff at!<br /> <br /> Who needs personal freedom, a sense of identity or an immortal soul with such work benefits?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T21:17:51-07:00","id":899721,"title":"","content":"I'd be whatever remains of an occultist trying to trade their humanity for as much power as possible without getting enslaved. Which probably means something's lunch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-25T22:13:21-07:00","id":899749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=892451#post892451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dunno what I'd actually be in CofD, but I'd sure love to be one of the Arisen. Best job security in the universe, relatively short work hours, and the health plan is nothing to scoff at!<br /> <br /> Who needs personal freedom, a sense of identity or an immortal soul with such work benefits?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is reasoning I can respect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T13:38:31-07:00","id":900312,"title":"","content":"I'm going to say a Stigmatic, because clearly I'm a mortal who's aware of the weirdness around him and even if I don't do anything about it I still have to accept the fact that I know it exists. Also, I can crack my jaw on command and the noise often unsettles those around me so said weirdness has no doubt marked me for life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Will Rotenberry</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer<br /> <b>Armory: Hurt Locker</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5031-bloodywillpower","name":"BloodyWillpower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-29T21:43:48-07:00","id":903268,"title":"","content":"Hmm. It comes down to three.<br /> <br /> 1 .Mage: Obrimos -Perfect Adepts or Thryus-Imagineers <br /> <br /> 2.Changeling lost: Darkling<br /> <br /> 3.Hunter: Ascended Ones<br /> <br /> Most likely to happen to me? I probably become an enscrolled mortal to some motley. I tend to befriend quite a few eccentric or sometimes shady people, usually i help them out with things or make them feel comfortable . It would be just my luck to find out a few of them were changelings and most likely from the Autumn or Summer Courts. Showing up at my house or in my house at random times of the night for &quot;favors&quot; or to &quot;crash&quot; at my place for a few days . <br /> <br /> &quot; Oh... don't mind that Hedge Gateway in your closet man... it'll disappear in a few days. We're just here to see that it does...so...whatcha got to eat here?&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>&quot;I am a daydreamer and a Night thinker.&quot;~</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1820-nightout","name":"Nightout","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1820_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-30T22:44:18-07:00","id":903968,"title":"","content":"Most likely? A stigmatic, some useful, but minor and utterly replaceable in the Machine's grand design.<br /> <br /> If we're talking major templates-well, I'd like to say mage of course. Massive cosmic power, limited-to-no downsides depending on how prudent you are. But I'm honestly not magely in the least, no sense of awe or emotional connection to symbols or grand ideals, a complete lack of interest in mystery, a reflexive distrust in any argument not based in those 'facts of middling import' as the quote goes. <br /> <br /> Probably a demon, really, probably a Wheel. I've got a natural talent for lying and hiding any emotional response, and am quite good at logistics and managing things to be in the right place at the right time. Plus the whole occult physics paradigm of the supernatural makes intuitive sense to me in a way none of the other options do. Tempter/Inquisitor for agenda, much as I'd like to say otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11821-st-just","name":"St.Just","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T13:43:16-07:00","id":904407,"title":"","content":"Tammuz following the Aurum Refinement.<br /> <br /> Sad, I know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T13:59:09-07:00","id":904423,"title":"","content":"I know I'd be an Uratha and an Iron Master (I am NOT an agent of chaos, but I am one for change), never quite sure which Auspice, though. Waffle between Irraka and Cahalith.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-31T15:26:32-07:00","id":904499,"title":"","content":"So, my best friend thinks I would a be a 1e Fetch because of my lucid dreaming (about every night), reoccurring nightmares and fear of mirrors... <br /> <br /> I could even hazard what I think is likely an accurate guess on what night I was abducted, if that actually happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 05-31-2016, 06:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T19:06:30-07:00","id":905324,"title":"","content":"Haven't dwelled on it, I think I'd /like/ to be an Obrimos Guardian who uses Prime to unveil Truth to the worthy and hide it from those aren't. Whether or not that's likely is another matter entirely - I don't see myself or the average person as being exceptional enough to Awaken, really - but that misses the point. <br /> <br /> The Chronicles of Darkness is a personal horror setting. It isn't about magical power fantasies.<br /> <br /> So in all honesty, CofD me has most likely signed a Soul Pact with one of the Unchained in the hopes of being personally annihilated without my presence in the world vanishing in an immediately damaging way. Cult membership and fae oaths are tempting, but subservience is waaay less tempting than a painless way out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 06-02-2016, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T20:10:25-07:00","id":905355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=905324#post905324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Haven't dwelled on it, I think I'd /like/ to be an Obrimos Guardian who uses Prime to unveil Truth to the worthy and hide it from those aren't.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, assuming that &quot;the worthy&quot; are still humans, basically a villain? Because all that Dissonance is going to really erode people's Integrity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T05:43:59-07:00","id":914029,"title":"","content":"I'm probably a 1e wizened changeling,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;Give before you take, or I'll hit you with a rake&quot; </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#545454\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">~ Socrates</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5638-kaizer-gibby","name":"Kaizer Gibby","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5638_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T08:10:47-07:00","id":914098,"title":"","content":"Someone's dot of Contacts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T14:02:19-07:00","id":914354,"title":"","content":"I went in fully expecting to see everyone pick Mage, justifying a smug comment about Mage supremacy being a problem, but turns out I'm a cynical idiot. <br /> <br /> Personally, I have to say that if I could pick I'd be very tempted to go Demon, definitely Tempter. The ability to speak any language, immortality, the chance to live countless different lives, ridiculous powers, being able to hulk out into a giant gigerian killbot...what more could you want?<br /> <br /> Realistically, though, my best case scenario would probably be ending up as a Deviant, Changeling, or cultist due to bad decisions, greed, and laziness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T00:52:43-07:00","id":914713,"title":"","content":"Mortal Cultist, hands down. <br /> <br /> Preferably to a real Lovecraftian entity that grants the faithful or useful dark powers and forbidden knowledge.<br /> <br /> Would settle for an Arisen, Unchained, God Machine, Underworld, or any Awakened backed Mystery Cult though. (Even the Seers, they probably pay the most anyways.)<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T08:35:17-07:00","id":914850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/804675-who-are-you-in-the-cofd?p=914713#post914713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mortal Cultist, hands down.<br /> <br /> Preferably to a real Lovecraftian entity that grants the faithful or useful dark powers and forbidden knowledge.<br /> <br /> Would settle for an Arisen, Unchained, God Machine, Underworld, or any Awakened backed Mystery Cult though. (Even the Seers, they probably pay the most anyways.)<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not Deceived? They get sweet powers at the higher ranks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T13:43:52-07:00","id":915053,"title":"","content":"Vent0,<br /> <br /> Thanks for the catch there, totally forgot about the Deceived. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T19:59:19-07:00","id":915312,"title":"","content":"Speaking realistically, I'd probably be a mortal occultist trying to discover the gods and afterlives without chaining myself to any of them. I might end us a Sin-Eater or Moros, sure, but it is more likely that I'l get dragged to one of the Invisible Realms after messing up a bargain or summoning ritual. My ghost might get imprisoned by a Mage who thinks it has more insights into gods and afterlives than it really does, and sent to the Underworld once it is no longer useful.<br /> <br /> Or I'll just end as collateral damage in the aftermath of a Hunter mission, with no important ghosts or spirits left behind. There's always that possibility when you're a mortal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}